      "writtenOn": "2017-08-23T00:52:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The constructor is an absolute pain to use in test. The goal of removing direct accessors is to make NetworkAgentInfo trivially mockable.\n\nSee for instance the new NetworkMonitorTest: it only takes\n\nwhen(mAgent.network()).thenReturn(new Network(TEST_ID));\n\nand I can ignore all the other stuff of the NAI ctor which are hard to tests, such as Messenger, AsyncChannel, ...",
