      "writtenOn": "2017-08-21T07:43:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would suggest using mContext here instead of having the caller pass in a Context object. Seems like it would make life simpler for callers, and avoid mistakes like passing in different context objects.\n\nNote also that one painful lesson that I learned is that the context object passed to settings is only used the first time and stashed in a static thereafter.\n\nAlso applies to the other non-static getters.",
