      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we go this route we\u0027ll eventually need to implement different versions of settings getters depending on the type of setting being read.\n\nConsider whether you need this or whether you can simply use FakeSettingsProvider instead.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1168,
